From e34728faacd3c7bd4ab487758e1c61ec675bace6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 02:57:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(exam): admin file library, merged multi-file exams,
 admin view of all exams

- exam_library_files + private storage bucket; RLS by has_role(admin); units analysed once at upload and cached
- Admin hub tab: upload with progress, auto-split into units, publish/draft, edit, re-split, delete
- Exam creator: choose library files (no upload) and/or own uploads, merge up to 8 files; per-file unit groups; distribution by unit/file
- exam_history: every created exam is recorded; admin RPC lists all exams with owner name/email, sources, online link, submissions; admin can view/close/delete and read results
- fix: Tabs were invisible on light backgrounds
